.DS_Store
.claude/

# .NET build output. Unanchored and generic ON PURPOSE: these previously existed as 20 explicit
# per-project lines (/src/Core/bin, /tests/Ui.Tests/obj, ...), which meant every NEW project silently
# started leaking its bin/obj into `git status` until someone remembered to add two more lines — and a
# stray `git add -A` would then commit build output. Adding src/RfCore + tests/RfCore.Tests hit exactly
# that (2026-07-30). Nothing tracked in this repo has ever lived under a bin/ or obj/ directory, so
# matching them at any depth is safe as well as robust.
bin/
obj/
TestResults/
/circuitRF_demo
/testdata/lpwave_test_data
/testdata/spl_test_data

# R-L5g-10 (brief-L5-followups-2.md §4): a workspace's .generated-cells/ folder is a pure, deletable,
# rebuildable-from-the-layout PCell regeneration cache (GeneratedCellStore/LayoutView.PCellSnapshots) —
# infrastructure, never content, and must never ship inside a workspace archive. Unanchored (not
# "/.generated-cells") because a workspace root can live at any depth under this repo (e.g. inside
# circuitRF_demo/ if it's ever unzipped and used locally), not only at the repo root.
.generated-cells/

# macOS VM host — build outputs and the image build cache (kernel/initramfs are built, never committed)
tools/macos-vmhost/build/
tools/macos-vmhost/.build/
tools/macos-vmimage/build/
tools/macos-vmimage/.work/

# Device worker and its test fixture — build outputs (native, rebuilt by their own build.sh)
tools/senior-worker/build/
tools/fake-model-lib/build/
